\newlabel{fig:powerlaw_taus}{{3.2}{9}{Estimates for $\hat {\tau }_s(L), \hat {\tau }_a(L)$. Dashed horizontal lines reflect the estimates $\hat {\tau }_s(100)$ and $\hat {\tau }_a(100)$}{figure.caption.5}{}}
