\newlabel{fig:powerlaw_fitted_mle}{{3.3}{9}{Fitted MLEs for a power law distribution against the simulated data, for select lattice sizes $L = 5, 30, 100$. The full data fits are depicted in Appendix Figure \ref {}. MLEs are drawn as black points with a connecting line drawn for illustration purposes. The right column shows avalanche size, while the left column shows avalanche area. The dashed vertical lines on the left show the bound on avalanche area, $L^2$}{figure.caption.6}{}}
